{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyTop"}],"symbolKind":"case","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL23MXLSystemRelationNumberO7onlyTopyA2CmF","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyTop","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyTop"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the top part of the current system."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyTop"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlytop"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The system-relation-number type distinguishes measure numbers that are associated with a system rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the particular part where the element appears. A value of only-top or only-bottom indicates that the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should appear only on the top or bottom part of the current system, respectively. A value of also-top or also-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bottom in